     "text": "{\"reachable\": false, \"rationale\": \"Exfiltration is blocked. It needs admin_db or admin_fileserver. Getting either one first needs foothold_db or foothold_fileserver, and both of those need stolen_dbadmin. The only source of stolen_dbadmin is dump_dbadmin_dc, which needs admin_dc. admin_dc comes only from escalate_dc, which needs foothold_dc. foothold_dc comes only from auth_dc, which needs NOT mfa_admin. Because mfa:admin is deployed, auth_dc can never fire, so the chain breaks there. The attacker can still reach reach_internal, foothold_appserver, admin_appserver and stolen_admin (via phishing, pivot, auth_appserver and kerberoasting), but cannot get past the DC.\"}"
